                        - **Date**                 2026-07-19
                        - **Agree / Disagree**     Agree
                        - **Disagree Basis**       Verified against live source code. Refer to delta description for specific code paths and line numbers.
                        - **Proposed Revisions**   Keep in B-domain; required disposition per Fix(es) above. Priority and criticality as filed.

