                                                   WitnessSigner.cs:137-158 (returns false on
                                                   non-member), via the Ed25519 migration (bedc0c9 +
                                                   working tree). However NO production caller supplies
                                                   it: AppModel.swift:414-416 and :605,
                                                   SyxxWitness.swift:81, AppViewModel.cs:290,
                                                   Windows/SyxxWitness/Program.cs:112 all call with the
                                                   default nil/null — verification everywhere is still
                                                   anchored only to the snapshot's own embedded key, and
                                                   the collector-attestation verify still uses
                                                   `result.publicKey` from the network response
                                                   (LeakDetector.swift:170-185; Windows equivalent). Do
                                                   NOT mark fixed until a caller actually pins.
                                                   Cross-ref is stale: "D006" now names the
                                                   MachineName-fingerprint delta (DELTAS.md:1774) after
                                                   the ID reshuffle; the transport-forgery overlap lives
                                                   at D003 (No TLS Pinning, Critical, DELTAS.md:1669).
                                                   Criticality: Medium is acceptable ONLY for the
                                                   witness half (self-verifying by design, pending the
