                         lists manually (`[localResolver] + ["1.1.1.1", "8.8.8.8", "9.9.9.9"]`)
                         while ProbePlan uses `.uniqued()`; the CLI has inline display and
                         advisory logic; ProbePlan returns raw `SectionInputs`. Currently in
                         sync, but if a new probe is added only to ProbePlan, the CLI silently
                         omits it — the same structural defect as C005 (Windows GUI) on a smaller
                         scale. Root cause: probe orchestration should live in one place (the
                         shared Kit) and be called from all frontends.
