                        rendering each `conclusion.advisories` entry with title, severity, detail —
                        both platforms. [Fix 2] §3 test: inputs with an `openResolver`
                        `.recursiveHighAmp` → `renderText()` contains the advisory title and
                        "high"; failure case: no advisory in inputs → the block is absent (does not
                        fabricate one).
- **Tag:**              CONFIRMED (source-read both platforms; advisory producer + renderText omission
                        verified; no run needed — the field is simply not referenced in renderText).


