                                                  version.bind ForwarderOnPublicPath ->
                                                  subs.Add(SectionStatus.Positive) gates the whole
                                                  Prophet section; Disclosed -> Negative; else
                                                  (incl. Withheld) -> Negative. macOS
                                                  Synthesizer.swift:206-213 is tilt-only
                                                  (ev.append; explicit 'no .positive, no gate'
                                                  contract). A spoofable CHAOS banner blocks a
                                                  warranted clean on Windows only, and Withheld
                                                  reads as clean - forgeable evidence driving a
                                                  platform-divergent verdict.
                       - **Proposed Revisions**   Agree with Fix1 (Windows emits the EvidenceItem
                                                  only, zero section status for every version.bind
                                                  state) + Fix2 (shared Kit helper so the tilt-
                                                  only contract can't drift). Critical (false-
                                                  confidence divergence from attacker-controllable
                                                  input). Parity section-3 test as specified.

