                                                  `Degraded → Degraded`, `Unreachable →
                                                  Invalidated`, and (via `default:`)
                                                  `Fast/Moderate/SLOW → Negative`
                                                  (Synthesizer.cs:138-140; enum
                                                  ResolverLatencyProbe.cs:9). Two divergences: (a) a
                                                  SLOW resolver is `.degraded` on macOS (withholds
                                                  the Prophet clean support — only `.Negative`
                                                  sections grant clean support,
                                                  SynthesisEngine.cs:154-156 / .swift:184-186) but
