                       - **Disagree Basis**       Verified live. macOS Synthesizer.swift:115 maps
                                                  .slow/.degraded/.unreachable -> .degraded; Windows
                                                  Synthesizer.cs:131-141 maps Degraded->Degraded,
                                                  Unreachable->Invalidated, and via default
                                                  Fast/Moderate/Slow->Negative. The divergence is
                                                  real: a Slow resolver grants clean support
                                                  (.Negative) on Windows but only a confidence
                                                  penalty (.Degraded, Conclusion.cs:32-33) on macOS;
                                                  Unreachable is Invalidated (BlocksClean,
                                                  Conclusion.cs:40) on Windows vs non-blocking
                                                  .degraded on macOS. Codex is correct.
