                                                  BOTH platforms (a resolver that answered nothing
                                                  cannot support a clean Prophet) and file the chosen
                                                  direction so it can't re-diverge. Priority medium:
                                                  parity/false-confidence magnitude, not a verdict
                                                  flip, so CRITICAL=N.

