                                                  is plausible — `@State` in SwiftUI panel subviews is
                                                  not observable by `resetAll()` on AppModel, a known
                                                  SwiftUI pattern gap. The fix (migrate panel-local state
                                                  to model, or add a `@Published` reset counter) is
                                                  correct. Criticality Non-critical is appropriate; this
                                                  is UX friction, not a verdict or evidence defect.
                                                  Missing: no code sample confirming the broken path.
                                                  Recommend a reviewer verify `resetAll()` at
