                                                  A013's atomic idempotency fix (kv_insert_once) prevents
                                                  double-mint but does not solve the cross-purchase
                                                  slot collision — A025 is correctly a separate delta.
                                                  Criticality Critical correct (payments, rule 5).
                                                  Additional consideration: "lifetime purchase" plans
                                                  (if any) that do not have a subscription_id will need
                                                  a sentinel value strategy with the per-subscription
                                                  key scheme, so the fix design should account for
                                                  non-subscription (one-time charge) entitlements.


