                                                  DNSSECVerifier.cs:55-58 identical — the Bool returns
                                                  true for an expired/not-yet-valid signature. grep
                                                  confirms NO in-tree callers of verifyDNSSEC /
                                                  VerifyDNSSECAsync besides the definitions, so this is
                                                  a dormant public-API dishonesty, not a demonstrated
                                                  end-user false verdict yet. Tri-state rule violated.
                       - **Proposed Revisions**   Agree; Fix 1 (remove the Bool wrapper, expose
