                                                  resolves are sequential (:125-156) each up to
                                                  `timeout` with no aggregate deadline. A hostile-
                                                  LAN mDNS flood -> orphan thread running
                                                  N*timeout plus unbounded memory.
                       - **Proposed Revisions**   Agree (Low; needs hostile LAN). Fix 1 (cap
                                                  resolves per type) + Fix 2 (concurrent resolves
                                                  under one hard aggregate deadline + cancel) --
                                                  the latter also cuts scan latency.

