                        even when that vantage returned neither DNSKEY nor RRSIG. A censoring system
                        resolver placed first therefore suppresses evidence available from UDP/DoH.
- **Cross-ref. Delta:** Related to A030, but persists even after setting DO.
- **Fix(es):**          [Fix 1] Collect every usable vantage and return corroborated tri-state
                        evidence; never let one negative vantage terminate the search.
