                                                  keep the explicit "presence-only, not validated"
                                                  disclosure.

**FIXED 2026-07-30 (qwen-code), already resolved.** `rrsig_window_status` checks `typeCovered == expected_type_covered` and returns 'wrong-type' for RRSIGs covering other RRsets; `zone_signing_status` filters out wrong-type statuses so they cannot satisfy DNSSEC observation.

