                                                  ordering signal the client deliberately keeps. Fix
                                                  the SERVER instead: emit document-ordered, duplicate-
                                                  preserving lists (drop set()/sorted() at :43,:57) so
                                                  both vantages share one ordered-with-dups
                                                  canonicalization. Priority: high — as written this is
                                                  a routine false-positive generator on real pages.

**FIXED 2026-07-30 (qwen-code), already resolved.** `_AssetExtractor` (warp.py) uses Python lists (not sets) for scripts, stylesheets, and iframes, preserving document order and duplicate occurrences. `parse_assets` returns the lists directly without set-deduplication or sorting.

