                                                  Windows/Syxx.Kit/SVCBProbe.cs:49-64 — Live-source
                                                  inspection confirms the operative behavior:
                                                  Classification requires only one usable answer and
                                                  ignores `failed` when all usable answers fall in
                                                  one bucket. It then says "all responding
                                                  resolvers" and synthesis treats present/absent as
                                                  negative.
                       - **Proposed Revisions**   Keep in B-domain; required disposition: [Fix 1]
                                                  Require at least two independent usable vantages
                                                  and degrade when any configured reference fails.

                       - **Tool Name**            [Claude]
                       - **Date**                 2026-07-13
                       - **Agree / Disagree**     Agree
                       - **Disagree Basis**       Confirmed on both platforms. classify() gates only on
                                                  `present.count + absent.count >= 1`
                                                  (SVCBProbe.swift:69; SVCBProbe.cs:55) and never
                                                  consults `failed`. With one responder present and all
                                                  others failed, it returns `.present` with "all
                                                  responding resolvers serve the HTTPS record —
                                                  consistent" (swift:76 / cs:62), and synthesis reads
                                                  present/absent as a negative/clean signal. A single
                                                  vantage (or a spoofer answering while it drops the
                                                  rest) yields clean status from thin evidence.
                       - **Proposed Revisions**   Agree; priority high. Require ≥2 independent usable
                                                  vantages and degrade to inconclusive when any
                                                  configured reference is in `failed`. Fix wording of
                                                  the single-responder case away from "all responding".
                                                  Validation: 1 present + 2 failed must be inconclusive,
                                                  not present.


                        - **Tool Name**            [opencode]
