                                                  inconclusive/weak unless corroborated (shared
                                                  provider ASN, matching CNAME target, or authoritative
                                                  agreement) plus timing. Validation: a two-sample
                                                  disjoint-but-same-ASN Cloudflare/Akamai capture must
                                                  NOT return unstable.


                        - **Tool Name**            [opencode]
                        - **Date**                 2026-07-19
                        - **Agree / Disagree**     Agree
                        - **Disagree Basis**       Verified against live source code. Refer to delta description for specific code paths and line numbers.
                        - **Proposed Revisions**   Keep in B-domain; required disposition per Fix(es) above. Priority and criticality as filed.

