                        `recursiveLowAmp`. The operation has no unknown state for measurement
                        failure, violating the tri-state rule.
- **Cross-ref. Delta:** B065 can trigger one instance, but any missing size does this.
- **Fix(es):**          [Fix 1] Make factor optional/typed and return untested when the amplification
                        query or byte measurement fails.
