                        reassembly path, so capture claims are incomplete without disclosure.
- **Cross-ref. Delta:** Not present in the current capture deltas.
- **Fix(es):**          [Fix 1] Add bounded TCP/53 flow reassembly and length-prefixed DNS parsing;
                        otherwise surface capture coverage as incomplete.
