                                                  behavior: IP parsing accepts protocol 17 (UDP)
                                                  only. There is no TCP stream framing or reassembly
                                                  path, so capture claims are incomplete without
                                                  disclosure.
                       - **Proposed Revisions**   Keep in C-domain; required disposition: [Fix 1]
                                                  Add bounded TCP/53 flow reassembly and
                                                  length-prefixed DNS parsing; otherwise surface
