                       - **Agree / Disagree**     Agree
                       - **Disagree Basis**       Confirmed both platforms.
                                                  parseIPUDPHeader rejects non-UDP: macOS
                                                  DNSCapture.swift:249,266
                                                  (protocolNumber==17 / nextHeader==17
                                                  else nil); Windows DNSCapture.cs:234,263
                                                  identical. No TCP/53 framing or
                                                  reassembly path exists, so DNS-over-TCP
                                                  (UDP-truncation fallback, large DNSSEC
