                                                  (SyxxCage/Program.cs) not opened.
                       - **Proposed Revisions**   Agree; Fix 1 (return validated end
                                                  offset ihl+udpLen; slice exactly the UDP
                                                  payload). Codex's C029 cross-ref/merge
                                                  is plausible but C029 is outside this
                                                  shard and unverified here. Priority
                                                  high: size-telemetry inflation plus
                                                  forgeable tail.


