                                                  The CLI syxx-witness verify then prints "VALID
                                                  (Tamper-evident - Ed25519 signed)"
                                                  (SyxxWitness.swift:99) with no distinction between
                                                  a key pinned to a known Syxx/operator anchor and
                                                  an arbitrary self-signed key. Key pinning exists
                                                  but is OFF by default and is never surfaced, so a
                                                  user cannot tell a self-attested snapshot from…
