                                                  "udp port 53" filter);
                                                  macOS/Sources/Ccage/Ccage.c:65-78 (pcap_compile +
                                                  pcap_setfilter). — [CONFIRMED] Windows capture
                                                  uses raw sockets with IOControlCode.ReceiveAll
                                                  (Program.cs:223), which captures ALL IP packets
                                                  regardless of protocol or port. The port-53 check
                                                  at line 104 (`context.SourcePort != 53 &&
                                                  context.DestPort != 53`) filters in userspace
                                                  after the full packet is read from the socket. On
                                                  macOS, the BPF filter `"udp port 53"`
                                                  (SyxxCage.swift:117) is compiled and applied at
                                                  the kernel level (Ccage.c:65-78), so only UDP
                                                  port-53 packets ever reach userspace. The
