                       - **Date**                 2026-07-13
                       - **Agree / Disagree**     Agree
                       - **Disagree Basis**       macOS/Sources/SyxxKit/ContentWarp.swift:325-347;
                                                  Windows/Syxx.Kit/ContentWarp.cs:327-349 —
