                                                  resolver.py:116-122 and :331-335. Codex is right
                                                  that the guard runs only when qd>0
                                                  (`if expected_qname is not None and qd > 0`), so a
                                                  spoof with QDCOUNT==0 + forged answers + matching
                                                  txid skips it entirely. Off-path exploitation still
