                                                  add a targeted runtime case before refiling.

                       - **Tool Name**            [Claude]
                       - **Date**                 2026-07-13
                       - **Agree / Disagree**     Disagree
                       - **Disagree Basis**       Debunked by runtime check. _encode_name at
                                                  resolver.py:45-52 encodes PER LABEL with an
                                                  empty-label guard (`label.encode("idna") if label
                                                  else b""`). Python's idna codec has an ASCII
                                                  fast-path, so `"_dmarc".encode("idna")` returns
