                                                  behavior: Windows labels the conclusion confidence
                                                  itself as TRUST SCORE regardless of verdict, so
                                                  95%-confident tampering displays trust 95. macOS
                                                  reverses the number for every non-clean verdict,
                                                  which can turn a low-confidence threat into high
                                                  green trust. Diagnostic confidence is not host
                                                  trust and neither arithmetic is valid. Archived
                                                  GUIA-17 remains live.
