                        500-line cap truncates only after full O(mn) time and memory are consumed.
                        The archived KTRU-36 “fixed” defect is still live on fetched HTML.
- **Cross-ref. Delta:** Client resource-safety family; hostile remote content is the input.
- **Fix(es):**          [Fix 1] Bound input bytes/lines before diff. [Fix 2] Use a memory-bounded
                        algorithm (Hirschberg/Myers) with cancellation and an operation budget.
- **Tag:**              CONFIRMED — REOPENED REGRESSION


