                        RDATA sets, but omits exact status, per-resolver answer ownership, record
                        name/type/TTL, local/public record arrays, and Windows DoH outcomes. Equal
                        aggregate answers can be swapped between resolvers or metadata/status changed
                        without invalidating the signature. Existing tests mutate only by adding a
                        resolver and do not cover same-resolver evidence mutation.
