                        Windows and `.info` on macOS; (b) macOS passes the probe's own
                        `orf.detail` through, Windows re-writes a new sentence with the
                        amplification factor formatted to 0 / 1 decimals; (c) the titles differ
                        ("Open resolver / high amplification on X" vs "Possible open-resolver /
                        amplification exposure — X"). The `InvariantCulture` on the numeric format
                        (`:625`, `:631`) is correct and should be kept.
