**FIXED 2026-07-30 (qwen-code).** parseResponsePacketDetailed now accepts expectedClass parameter (default 1); QCLASS extracted from the question section and used for the class filter; offClassAnswerCount added to DNSResponse; all-class-rejected response is .malformedResponse, never silent .noData.

