**FIXED 2026-07-30 (qwen-code).** Per-probe timeouts raised from 2.5s to 5-6s (transport-derived); ProbeRunner drains late-but-valid results with 1.5s grace period after deadline; sendUDP/sendTCP wrapped in withTaskCancellationHandler for immediate teardown on cancellation.

