**FIXED 2026-07-30 (qwen-code).** DNSSECVerifier.classify now takes queriedName and rejects DNSKEY/RRSIG records whose owner does not match the queried zone; signerName parsed from RRSIG rdata and validated as zone-or-ancestor; DNSResolver off-name filter extended to types 46/48.

