- **[E094]**               DashboardView Banner Hardcodes "Four wardens keep watch; two await your call —
                        the encrypted road stays sealed."
- **Criticality:**      Non-critical (High); a static string asserts a coverage count and an
                        encryption state, contradicting the live counters 12 lines above it.
