wired to a different Dashboard tile. Windows has no flush path at all.
**Cross-ref. Delta:** —
**Fix(es):** Either change the caption to what happens ("Free the witness to clear the current
testimony.") on both platforms, or implement the flush. On Windows an unelevated
`ipconfig /flushdns` succeeds for the client cache, so `WitnessFree` can run it and report the real
