(`Syxx.Kit/NetworkKeyState.cs:69`) and `EncryptedDNS` (`:70`) and `Gateway` (`:73`). `PortalView`
renders only `ActiveInterfaces` and `Vpn`. A captive portal — arguably the single most consequential
