**[E154]** W3-31 — Glutton is badged "PRO" in the sidebar but has no entitlement gate
**Criticality:** LOW-MEDIUM (inconsistent claim; the opposite error to W3-07)
**Location:** `MainWindow.xaml:183-191` · `ViewModels/AppViewModel.cs:360-398` · `Views/LicenseView.xaml:96-98`
**Issue:** The Glutton nav item carries the gold lock + "PRO" pill, and `LicenseView` lists
"Syxx Leak • DNS privacy logging" under Pro. `RunGluttonAsync` has no `IsPro` check — it runs the
collector test for everyone, passing `licenseKey: null` when `LicenseKey` is empty
(`AppViewModel.cs:388`). So the sidebar states a restriction that does not exist, while Mirror states
none and enforces one silently. `GluttonView` separately renders the real entitlement in its
FEATURE STATUS card (`:43-48`) via `LicenseManager`, which is the correct source — it just disagrees
with the sidebar.
**Cross-ref. Delta:** E028.
**Fix(es):** Decide the entitlement once. Either remove the PRO pill from the Glutton nav item, or
gate it the way `GluttonView`'s own status card already reports, and never with a silent `return`.
**Code Sample:**
```xml
<!-- MainWindow.xaml:186-190 -->
<FontIcon Glyph="&#xE72E;" FontSize="10" Foreground="{StaticResource IoGoldBrush}" />
<TextBlock Text="PRO" FontSize="9" FontWeight="Bold" ... />
```

