**[E158]** W3-35 — Resolver addresses are painted success-green on two panes regardless of state
**Criticality:** LOW
**Location:** `Views/DashboardView.xaml:42-44` · `Views/ProphetView.xaml:17-20`
**Issue:** Both `ResolverText` and `LocalResolverText` hard-code
`Foreground="{StaticResource IoSuccessGreenBrush}"`. The code-behind writes `"—"`
(`DashboardView.xaml.cs:41`) or `"not detected"` (`ProphetView.xaml.cs:29-30`) when no resolver was
found — rendered in the app's success colour. Green is the app's scarcest signal and it is being
spent on an unmeasured field.
**Fix(es):** Neutral `IoTextBrush` for the address; reserve green for graded state only.

