**[E161]** W3-38 — `RemoteContentPanel.OnNavigatedTo` is an empty override carrying a stale promise
**Criticality:** LOW
**Location:** `Views/RemoteContentPanel.xaml.cs:206-211`
**Issue:** The override does nothing but `base`, under the comment "If WebView2 fails to load, show
offline overlay (handled via NavigationFailed event in future if needed)". That work was in fact done
— `core.NavigationCompleted` at `:72-76` — and the file even documents at `:66-71` why the old
"in future if needed" comment was wrong. The stale copy remains and reads as an outstanding gap.
**Fix(es):** Delete the override and the comment.

