- **[F047]**               209 Quarantined macOS Tests Are Uncompilable by Construction; Among Them the Only Coverage `TrayIndicators`, `FirstRunScan` and `DNSCanaries` Have Ever Had
- **Criticality:**      Critical
- **Location:**         macOS/Tests/_quarantine/ (19 files, 209 `func test`);
                        macOS/Package.swift (test targets `SyxxKitTests`, `SyxxAppTests` only —
                        `_quarantine` is in no target path)
- **Issue:**            SwiftPM resolves the two declared test targets to `Tests/SyxxKitTests` and
                        `Tests/SyxxAppTests`; `macOS/Tests/_quarantine/` belongs to neither, so its
                        files are never compiled, never type-checked and never run. Nothing under
                        `macOS/`, `.github/` or `scripts/` references `_quarantine`, so there is no
                        tracking issue, no expiry, and no mechanism that would ever surface them
                        again. Roughly 33 of the 209 are explicitly named false-clean / no-data
                        guards, e.g.:
                          `testCaptureOnlyNeverProducesCleanVerdict` (MonitorReportAnalyzerTests:36)
                          `testZeroRecordsYieldNilExfilSoCageStaysUntested` (…:48 — "empty capture must
                            map to nil (untested), not [] (clean)", :50)
                          `testNoSignalsAtAll_ReturnsNil_NotZero` (ScorersContractTests:24)
                          `testZeroEvidenceMirror_CannotCarryAnOtherwiseCleanRunToClean` (…:205)
                          `testAbsentStage5RendersUnavailableNotClean` (Stage5DisplayModelTests:16)
                          `testNilConfidenceRendersNoEstimateNotZeroPercent` (…:65)
                          `testCleanButHardGatedTrayIsNeverGreen` (SoWhatLayerTests:156)
                          `testNeverScannedIsUnknownNeverGreen` (…:148)
                          `testTrayNeverDisagreesWithTheReportCard` (…:169)
                          `testNeverFalseSecure_universalInvariant` (Stage0GoldenCorpusTests:165)
                          `testMergeNeverLetsALaterNilEraseEarlierEvidence` (FirstRunScanTests:81)
                        Cross-referencing each quarantined subject against the ACTIVE test dirs
